// Top 20 alert titles
// Question: Which alerts keep coming back?
// Tables:   AlertInfo
// Workbook: Table - Building a Defender Security Dashboard with Workbooks, Part 3
//
// Author:   Seán O'Farrell - https://cloud-secure.ai/
// Runs as-is in Microsoft Defender advanced hunting.

AlertInfo
| where Timestamp > ago(30d)
| summarize Alerts = dcount(AlertId), LastSeen = max(Timestamp) by Title, ServiceSource, Severity
| top 20 by Alerts desc
